# Momin Agro (মোমিন এগ্রো) - Supabase Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to '.env' or '.env.local' and provide your actual Supabase project credentials.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - Only provide your Supabase Project URL and Anon (Public) Key.
# - NEVER place your Supabase service_role key, database password, or server secrets here.
# - The application will run in honest Demo Mode ("নমুনা তথ্য") when these keys are unconfigured.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Single-Family Farm Configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: customize the internal farm account email (defaults to ekraislamohi2023@gmail.com).
# Security notice: Never place passwords in environment variables or frontend code.
# The father unlocks the device once with his password; Supabase client securely
# persists the authenticated session token on that device for all future visits.
#
# VITE_FARM_EMAIL=ekraislamohi2023@gmail.com


